<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GCC cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GCC cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analysts Hector Castillo and David Castricone have cut their rating for Mexico's Grupo Cementos de Chihuahua SA de CV to sell from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has rallied 50 percent in dollar terms since the end of April and at current levels appears fully valued,&quot; they wrote in a July 17 report.</p>
<p>-- The company's B shares were off 0.44 peso to 10.30 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
